    "detailed_description": "Hi and welcome in a single-player, souls-like experience. Uncover the path to Agartha, the legendary city hidden deep within the Earth. Equip yourself with legendary weapons, discover powerful items, and explore secret areas brimming with lore. Beware of deadly traps, intricate elevators, and long-buried secrets from the past as you navigate this dark, mysterious world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/6ecb2c5bab97743f5009554fdf9f0548.avif?t=1728923707\" width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BACKSTORY</h2>In the heart of the Earth lies the ancient city of Agartha, where gods and higher beings reside. Once, in cycles long past, humans were welcomed into Agartha, partaking in its divine grace and wisdom. Until a grievous sin, committed by humanity, led to their expulsion, and Agartha's gates were closed to mortals forever. The gods, with their celestial foresight, constructed Arks to ensure the survival of the chosen ones \u2013 humans who would bear the knowledge and warnings of each cycle to future generations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/2da90b52228a87fc3b6d34d5e1295f0f.poster.avif?t=1728923707\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/2da90b52228a87fc3b6d34d5e1295f0f.webm?t=1728923707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/2da90b52228a87fc3b6d34d5e1295f0f.mp4?t=1728923707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Our tale follows Lord Velimir, a warrior embarking on the ultimate quest to breach the gates of Agartha and seek forgiveness for humanity\u2019s past transgressions. Velimir's journey takes him through dungeons, underworld, and wastelands, each fraught with its own dangers and mysteries.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/02cfa30ac6eff545a8cedb8eb6aaf988.poster.avif?t=1728923707\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/02cfa30ac6eff545a8cedb8eb6aaf988.webm?t=1728923707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/02cfa30ac6eff545a8cedb8eb6aaf988.mp4?t=1728923707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GOAL</h2>Throughout his journey, we uncover lost knowledge and ancient artifacts that shed light on the true nature of the cycles and the divine expulsion. This knowledge holds the key to understanding the past sins and the path to redemption.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >----------</h2>For countless eons the world has been destroyed and nearly every living thing killed, leaving behind no more than a  few survivors to warn forthcoming generations of the destruction that awaits. Every survivor tells the same rumour, that only one thing survives this destruction unscathed: Agartha, the first city.  <br><br>Time is up. The cycle must continue and this world will be destroyed.",
