 journey takes him through dungeons, underworld, and wastelands, each fraught with its own dangers and mysteries.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/02cfa30ac6eff545a8cedb8eb6aaf988.poster.avif?t=1728923707\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/02cfa30ac6eff545a8cedb8eb6aaf988.webm?t=1728923707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692890/extras/02cfa30ac6eff545a8cedb8eb6aaf988.mp4?t=1728923707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GOAL</h2>Throughout his journey, we uncover lost knowledge and ancient artifacts that shed light on the true nature of the cycles and the divine expulsion. This knowledge holds the key to understanding the past sins and the path to redemption.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >----------</h2>For countless eons the world has been destroyed and nearly every living thing killed, leaving behind no more than a  few survivors to warn forthcoming generations of the destruction that awaits. Every survivor tells the same rumour, that only one thing survives this destruction unscathed: Agartha, the first city.  <br><br>Time is up. The cycle must continue and this world will be destroyed.",
