        "notes": "Our game contains mature themes, including depictions of intense violence, dark fantasy elements, and challenging gameplay. Players will encounter combat with various adversaries, leading to intense and stylized violence. While the game does not explicitly depict sexual acts, the narrative may touch upon mature themes, such as the consequences of war, loss, and sacrifice. Additionally, the game may allude to elements of drug and alcohol use in the context of the game world. It\u2019s important to note that while the game does not contain explicit depictions of sensitive topics like sexual assault/non-consensual sex, it delves into themes of struggle, survival, and the darker aspects of a challenging, harsh world. We advise discretion for players sensitive to intense violence, dark fantasy themes, and mature storylines."
